   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Pre-rendering the fixed prompts is not a micro-optimisation: it removes ~0.6 s per turn,\n~29% of per-call cost, and it is what makes the offline kiosk possible at all.",
   "originalText": "Pre-rendering the fixed prompts is not a micro-optimisation: it removes ~0.6 s per turn,\n~29% of per-call cost, and it is what makes the offline kiosk possible at all.",
