   "text": "concept_id  TRADE.TAILORING\nsurface     silai, silai-kadhai, darzi, thaiyal, buni-silai\nphonetic    S400, T400   (Double Metaphone over transliteration)\ndialect     bho: silai ke kaam   -   mag: sivai",
