   "locked": false,
   "text": "STAGE 0   ELIGIBILITY GATE - rules only, no model, no score\nNSQF entry requirement vs (Q1 education  U  Q2 experience substitution)\nQ5 constraint vs job-role demands - radius vs haversine to nearest PMKK / NSTI / ITI\n-> returns THREE buckets:  ELIGIBLE  |  NEAR_MISS (with the exact gap)  |  INELIGIBLE",
   "originalText": "STAGE 0   ELIGIBILITY GATE - rules only, no model, no score\nNSQF entry requirement vs (Q1 education  U  Q2 experience substitution)\nQ5 constraint vs job-role demands - radius vs haversine to nearest PMKK / NSTI / ITI\n-> returns THREE buckets:  ELIGIBLE  |  NEAR_MISS (with the exact gap)  |  INELIGIBLE",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
