   "text": "PROVENANCE: NQR official export, 2,814 rows, sha256 348bed87... - NSQF 2023 entry table, typed by hand\nNCO-2015 = signal only (NCVET: 156/2157 mis-mapped, 256 unmappable) - 2-3 pilot districts, sourced + dated\nFields the official source does not provide are NULL, not guessed. No invented QP codes, ever.",
