   "text": "BLOCKER 1 - resume on a phone hash\nleaks and corrupts records\nBrother redials, READBACK speaks his sister's\ndisability disclosure aloud, and his answers\noverwrite hers under her consent record.\nFIX: DTMF resume PIN. See panel 6.",
   "originalText": "BLOCKER 1 - resume on a phone hash\nleaks and corrupts records\nBrother redials, READBACK speaks his sister's\ndisability disclosure aloud, and his answers\noverwrite hers under her consent record.\nFIX: DTMF resume PIN. See panel 6.",
