   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BLOCKER 2 - the Rs 5.60 figure is wrong\nInbound toll-free bills the RECEIVER at a\npremium (Rs 1.20-2.50/min), Exotel AgentStream\nis a paid add-on, and the GPU was excluded.\nReal figure: Rs 488/head at 1,000. See panel 10.",
   "originalText": "BLOCKER 2 - the Rs 5.60 figure is wrong\nInbound toll-free bills the RECEIVER at a\npremium (Rs 1.20-2.50/min), Exotel AgentStream\nis a paid add-on, and the GPU was excluded.\nReal figure: Rs 488/head at 1,000. See panel 10.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "bk2",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
