   "text": "MAJOR - self-hosted ASR is Rs 4.29 lakh/yr idle\nand does not even carry the WER argument:\n26.8 is IndicWhisper's number, not IndicConformer's.\nFIX: Bhashini/Sarvam metered by default,\nself-hosted as the switch you demo.",
   "originalText": "MAJOR - self-hosted ASR is Rs 4.29 lakh/yr idle\nand does not even carry the WER argument:\n26.8 is IndicWhisper's number, not IndicConformer's.\nFIX: Bhashini/Sarvam metered by default,\nself-hosted as the switch you demo.",
