   "locked": false,
   "text": "MAJOR - no NEAR_MISS producer, so R4's fourth\noutput (skill gaps requiring intervention) had\nnobody emitting it. Contradicts decisions.md.\nFIX: the gate returns three buckets, not one.\nReturn-type change, not an architecture change.",
   "originalText": "MAJOR - no NEAR_MISS producer, so R4's fourth\noutput (skill gaps requiring intervention) had\nnobody emitting it. Contradicts decisions.md.\nFIX: the gate returns three buckets, not one.\nReturn-type change, not an architecture change.",
