   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MAJOR - no PM-DAKSH routing. The guidelines say\nonly beneficiaries NOT covered by PM-DAKSH may be\nconsidered. We would have recommended GIA money\nPM-AJAY is forbidden to spend. FIX: Stage 0.5.",
   "originalText": "MAJOR - no PM-DAKSH routing. The guidelines say\nonly beneficiaries NOT covered by PM-DAKSH may be\nconsidered. We would have recommended GIA money\nPM-AJAY is forbidden to spend. FIX: Stage 0.5.",
