   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MAJOR - DPDP: we cited the wrong rules.\nRule 10 is CHILDREN. Rule 11 is persons with\ndisability, and it only bites when a guardian is\nappointed by a court / designated authority /\nLOCAL LEVEL COMMITTEE. So branch on decisional\ncapacity, not on disability - treating every\nmobility disclosure as incapacity is its own harm.",
   "originalText": "MAJOR - DPDP: we cited the wrong rules.\nRule 10 is CHILDREN. Rule 11 is persons with\ndisability, and it only bites when a guardian is\nappointed by a court / designated authority /\nLOCAL LEVEL COMMITTEE. So branch on decisional\ncapacity, not on disability - treating every\nmobility disclosure as incapacity is its own harm.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "mj4",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
