   "text": "MINOR - cross-channel resume is a NOTICE defect, not a purpose defect. The purpose is unchanged;\nwhat breaks is that the spoken consent script never named Meta as a recipient. FIX: name all four\nsurfaces in the one consent script, and gate the first turn on any NEW channel behind a one-line\npurpose restatement. Same turn as the resume PIN - one prompt buys both.",
   "originalText": "MINOR - cross-channel resume is a NOTICE defect, not a purpose defect. The purpose is unchanged;\nwhat breaks is that the spoken consent script never named Meta as a recipient. FIX: name all four\nsurfaces in the one consent script, and gate the first turn on any NEW channel behind a one-line\npurpose restatement. Same turn as the resume PIN - one prompt buys both.",
