   "locked": false,
   "text": "MINOR - \"DTMF on every closed-set field\" overstates it. Of the seven mandated fields exactly one\n(self vs wage) is natively DTMF-able; education is borderline. DTMF really covers language pick,\nyes/no confirms and the new PIN - about 3 of 11 turns. Keep it, but don't let it anchor the cost model.",
   "originalText": "MINOR - \"DTMF on every closed-set field\" overstates it. Of the seven mandated fields exactly one\n(self vs wage) is natively DTMF-able; education is borderline. DTMF really covers language pick,\nyes/no confirms and the new PIN - about 3 of 11 turns. Keep it, but don't let it anchor the cost model.",
