   "text": "MINOR - two scheme hooks missing from recommendation: the financial-literacy component that every\ncourse must carry (Ch.3 7A.a.iv), and the Rs 50,000 / 50%-of-project-cost asset grant that is\nconditional on a bank loan. Basic Issue 2 names both. Two boolean columns and one spoken line.",
   "originalText": "MINOR - two scheme hooks missing from recommendation: the financial-literacy component that every\ncourse must carry (Ch.3 7A.a.iv), and the Rs 50,000 / 50%-of-project-cost asset grant that is\nconditional on a bank loan. Basic Issue 2 names both. Two boolean columns and one spoken line.",
