   "text": "COVERAGE BEFORE THE FIXES:   R1 R3 R5 R6 R8 covered   -   R2 R4 R7 R9 partial   -   Basic Issues 3 and 4 MISSING   (1.5 of 5)\nR2 is partial for one reason only: the dialect measurement does not exist yet. decisions.md says \"we publish the measurement\" -\nuntil the 30-utterance test set is recorded, R2 is a claim and not a fact. It is the first thing to schedule and the first thing that will slip.",
   "originalText": "COVERAGE BEFORE THE FIXES:   R1 R3 R5 R6 R8 covered   -   R2 R4 R7 R9 partial   -   Basic Issues 3 and 4 MISSING   (1.5 of 5)\nR2 is partial for one reason only: the dialect measurement does not exist yet. decisions.md says \"we publish the measurement\" -\nuntil the 30-utterance test set is recorded, R2 is a claim and not a fact. It is the first thing to schedule and the first thing that will slip.",
